Warpeer is based on Warp upstream commit 17f4ec80ffa80749be035b2c2405e0f180a60e2e.
The modifications turn Warp into a terminal-only product: account, cloud, hosted AI,
telemetry, and auto-update features are removed or disabled, and Warpeer-specific
terminal, pane, theme, privacy, and plugin features are added.

